1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
"Tamed."

2
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:03,159
Don't be scared.

3
00:02:03,159 --> 00:02:04,159
I'm here.

4
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,919
Don't be scared.

5
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,920
I'm here.

6
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:20,000
(EP 1: Taking Home a Stray "Puppy")

7
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:28,919
"Cheng Yu'an"
Deep hypnosis only treats your symptoms.

8
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,240
What you need is a stable relationship.

9
00:02:31,759 --> 00:02:32,759
Or...

10
00:02:33,719 --> 00:02:35,319
a pet to keep you company.

11
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,960
Morning, Lawyer Cheng.

12
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:06,560
Lawyer Cheng.

13
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,840
About the Lin Yuanshan case.

14
00:03:07,841 --> 00:03:09,256
Chairman Cheng has new instructions.

15
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:09,919
Understood.

16
00:03:09,919 --> 00:03:10,520
We'll talk after.

17
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,520
Of course.

18
00:03:14,579 --> 00:03:16,592
[Settlement Agreement]

19
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,975
(Wang Xuan)
The third additional clause.

20
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,359
No objection from your side within 72 hours

21
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,439
constitutes acceptance.

22
00:03:23,599 --> 00:03:24,719
You're out of the game.

23
00:03:25,639 --> 00:03:26,639
Cheng Yu'an!

24
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,039
You've gone too far!

25
00:03:28,599 --> 00:03:30,039
Don't think I don't fucking know.

26
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:32,039
You set this whole thing up!

27
00:03:33,759 --> 00:03:34,879
However,

28
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,560
if you'd like to take this further,

29
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:38,120
I'd be happy to oblige.

30
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,645
(Cheng Yuze)
Those songs were mine to begin with.

31
00:03:43,319 --> 00:03:45,120
But I love seeing you like this.

32
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:47,079
You can't stand me,

33
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,439
but you can't beat my brother.

34
00:03:57,039 --> 00:03:58,199
Lawyer Cheng.

35
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,319
You really love going for the jugular.

36
00:04:01,759 --> 00:04:07,360
Is that how Cheng Group
handled the Lin Yuanshan case, too?

37
00:04:17,439 --> 00:04:20,759
This settlement agreement
will expire at 9 a.m. tomorrow.

38
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:23,079
After that,

39
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,279
we'll have our showdown in court.

40
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,638
Send me the address
of Lin Yuanshan's gallery.

41
00:04:34,639 --> 00:04:35,639
I'll go over there.

42
00:04:36,519 --> 00:04:37,360
Brother!

43
00:04:37,361 --> 00:04:38,599
You were amazing back there.

44
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,560
I'm serious.

45
00:04:39,561 --> 00:04:41,000
That old guy was livid!

46
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:43,680
Cheng Yuze's brother
never loses. Ask anyone.

47
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,318
What were they thinking,

48
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:46,759
coming here to pick a fight?

49
00:04:50,439 --> 00:04:51,959
Try staying out of trouble next time.

50
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,800
All right, I get it.

51
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:56,800
Brother.

52
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,560
Where will you go?

53
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,680
Let me come with you.

54
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,800
No need.

55
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,480
I threw your stuff out.

56
00:05:08,959 --> 00:05:10,680
Can't afford rent? Don't rent a place.

57
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:16,300
(Lin Qi / Lin Yuanshan's son)

58
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,360
Stop!

59
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:04,079
I said stop!

60
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,399
Those are my dad's paintings!

61
00:06:05,779 --> 00:06:06,779
(Zhao Tu)
Listen, kid.

62
00:06:07,079 --> 00:06:08,079
Don't blame me.

63
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,160
Your dad's paintings...

64
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,319
When he was alive, they were art.

65
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,800
Now he's dead, they're assets.

66
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,800
He owed me a fortune.

67
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:19,040
Don't I get to decide what happens to them?

68
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,639
One less painting on the market,

69
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,959
and the rest will go up by 30%.

70
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,319
Let go of me!

71
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:26,399
My dad was framed!

72
00:06:26,439 --> 00:06:27,720
He never owed anyone money!

73
00:06:29,839 --> 00:06:33,160
Each painting we burn will
make the rest worth more.

74
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,079
You should be happy.

75
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,160
You...

76
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:55,319
Please stop burning them!

77
00:06:55,319 --> 00:06:56,319
I'm begging you!

78
00:06:56,319 --> 00:06:57,319
Begging?

79
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,720
What the fuck have you got to offer?

80
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,800
Isn't that Lin Yuanshan's son?

81
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,239
Yeah.

82
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:23,199
Lin Yuanshan used to have it all.

83
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,759
Now his son doesn't even have a home.

84
00:07:43,519 --> 00:07:44,519
Bro,

85
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:45,800
Should we go after him?

86
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,120
Let him go.

87
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:51,879
Interesting.

88
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,600
What are you doing here?

89
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:11,199
Waiting for Mommy to buy me candy.

90
00:08:12,785 --> 00:08:14,186
You'll catch a cold in the rain.

91
00:08:17,759 --> 00:08:18,759
Sweetie!

92
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,040
I've got your cotton candy.

93
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,240
Come here!

94
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:23,278
Big brother, you're hurt.

95
00:08:23,279 --> 00:08:24,360
You need to cover up.

96
00:08:27,605 --> 00:08:28,485
It doesn't hurt.

97
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,439
I'm okay.

98
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:30,800
But...

99
00:08:32,772 --> 00:08:34,933
Take your umbrella. Don't run too fast.

100
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:37,120
Big brother will go fight monsters, too.

101
00:08:37,726 --> 00:08:38,726
You can do it!

102
00:08:38,986 --> 00:08:40,106
Bye, big brother!

103
00:08:40,273 --> 00:08:41,273
Slow down!

104
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,840
Mr. Lin Qi.

105
00:08:58,016 --> 00:09:00,255
Your mother, Chen Ruosheng,
has an unpaid balance

106
00:09:00,279 --> 00:09:02,200
of 69,800 yuan for her hospital treatment.

107
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:04,279
Please pay within three days

108
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,760
to avoid interrupting her treatment.

109
00:09:41,679 --> 00:09:42,799
That's mine.

110
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,200
What's the name?

111
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:46,159
Lin Qi.

112
00:09:46,159 --> 00:09:47,159
Qi, as in 'to perch'.

113
00:09:49,879 --> 00:09:50,879
I meant the medication.

114
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:53,399
Fluoxetine.

115
00:09:58,679 --> 00:09:59,720
Thanks.

116
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,799
You take it, too?

117
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,160
How are you related to Lin Yuanshan?

118
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,360
He's my dad.

119
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,600
Get in.

120
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,200
What?

121
00:10:22,399 --> 00:10:23,799
You can stay here

122
00:10:24,159 --> 00:10:25,798
and run into those thugs again.

123
00:10:25,799 --> 00:10:26,799
Or...

124
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,399
get in my car.

125
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,840
Now.

126
00:10:30,519 --> 00:10:31,519
I'll...

127
00:10:35,665 --> 00:10:38,625
I'll take you to get your wounds
treated. I bumped into you earlier.

128
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,679
In 30 seconds,

129
00:10:40,919 --> 00:10:42,200
I will drive away.

130
00:11:04,853 --> 00:11:06,626
[Cheng Yuze]

131
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,279
Brother.

132
00:11:07,340 --> 00:11:08,220
Can you do me a favor?

133
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,000
It's urgent.

134
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,120
What is it?

135
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,279
I just found out.

136
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:13,320
Lin Yuanshan, that painter he mentioned...

137
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:15,440
His son goes to the
Academy of Fine Arts with me.

138
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:17,240
After what happened to his dad,

139
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,720
his mom fell into a coma, too.

140
00:11:18,799 --> 00:11:20,240
Debt collectors hound him every day.

141
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,399
Now I can't reach him.

142
00:11:21,399 --> 00:11:22,399
I want to help him.

143
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:24,719
Can you use your contacts to find him?

144
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,720
Brother?

145
00:11:26,279 --> 00:11:27,840
He's already in my car.

146
00:11:53,846 --> 00:11:56,459
[Shen Mo, Therapist]

147
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,200
Come in.

148
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:38,720
The container's a little dirty.

149
00:12:55,759 --> 00:12:56,759
Change your shoes.

150
00:13:48,879 --> 00:13:49,879
Come here.

151
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:51,240
Clean yourself up.

152
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:27,840
Zafe.

153
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:30,840
That's my name.

154
00:15:32,039 --> 00:15:33,039
Say it.

155
00:15:34,279 --> 00:15:35,279
Zafe.

156
00:15:36,519 --> 00:15:37,519
What's yours?

157
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:38,840
It doesn't matter.

158
00:15:51,639 --> 00:15:52,639
Hold still.

159
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:02,919
It hurts.

160
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,000
Hold still.

161
00:16:04,519 --> 00:16:05,519
Be good.

162
00:16:11,759 --> 00:16:12,759
Look at me.

163
00:16:14,039 --> 00:16:15,080
Don't hold back.

164
00:16:16,879 --> 00:16:17,879
Keep going.

165
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:09,480
You're a lot like it.

166
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:12,680
What?

167
00:17:14,799 --> 00:17:15,799
Nothing.

168
00:17:22,025 --> 00:17:23,279
You're friends with Cheng Yuze?

169
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:26,160
We're close.

170
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,480
You need a place to stay?

171
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:39,920
Yes.

172
00:17:40,119 --> 00:17:41,279
If you'll let me,

173
00:17:41,799 --> 00:17:43,359
I could pay you with my paintings.

174
00:17:43,792 --> 00:17:44,799
Will you get famous?

175
00:17:47,519 --> 00:17:48,519
A painting...

176
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:51,519
It's only valuable once the artist dies.

177
00:17:54,559 --> 00:17:55,640
But...

178
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:59,000
I don't have anything else.

179
00:18:19,279 --> 00:18:21,200
Right now, I need a pet.

180
00:18:21,839 --> 00:18:23,160
And a stable relationship.

181
00:18:23,559 --> 00:18:24,640
If you're willing,

182
00:18:26,599 --> 00:18:27,720
you can stay here.

183
00:18:28,519 --> 00:18:30,200
I'll help you with the rest.

184
00:18:30,920 --> 00:18:31,920
Twenty-one days.

185
00:18:33,039 --> 00:18:34,039
A trial period.

186
00:18:36,359 --> 00:18:37,480
A pet?

187
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:38,960
It's just a label.

188
00:18:39,839 --> 00:18:41,640
Companionship that
provides emotional value.

189
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,000
Of course,

190
00:18:44,039 --> 00:18:45,240
you can say no.

191
00:19:02,606 --> 00:19:03,752
[Chen Ruosheng, Mother to Lin [Qi]]

192
00:19:03,777 --> 00:19:04,806
[Hospital bill for
over 5000 yuan]

193
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:21,039
You asked me about Lin Yuanshan.

194
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:23,240
You know about his case,

195
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:24,759
don't you?

196
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:27,720
Yes.

197
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:34,960
I'll do it.

198
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:39,160
I need money for my mom's medical bills.

199
00:19:41,079 --> 00:19:42,079
Could you help?

200
00:19:46,119 --> 00:19:47,119
Your account number.

201
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:13,559
He's so much like you.

202
00:20:14,799 --> 00:20:15,799
Xiao Qi.

203
00:20:30,839 --> 00:20:31,936
You'll sleep in the guest room.

204
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:33,039
Twenty-one days.

205
00:20:33,359 --> 00:20:34,359
Sign this.

206
00:20:34,519 --> 00:20:36,200
You can still back out before you sign.

207
00:20:49,416 --> 00:20:51,256
[1st episode: over]

208
00:20:51,740 --> 00:20:52,619
Lawyer Cheng.

209
00:20:52,620 --> 00:20:54,098
I've sent some files on
the Lin Yuanshan case

210
00:20:54,099 --> 00:20:55,500
to your phone.

211
00:20:56,643 --> 00:20:59,583
[Lin Yuanshan's son Lin Qi. Places he frequents:
The corner store on Hui'an Road, the hospital]

212
00:21:06,819 --> 00:21:07,940
What are you doing here?

213
00:21:18,099 --> 00:21:19,460
Why are you all alone?

214
00:21:20,700 --> 00:21:21,819
Where's your owner?

215
00:21:24,099 --> 00:21:25,420
What's your name?

216
00:21:35,019 --> 00:21:35,859
Lawyer Cheng.

217
00:21:35,860 --> 00:21:37,379
The fluoxetine I bought you today...

218
00:21:37,380 --> 00:21:38,380
You left it at the office.

219
00:21:38,381 --> 00:21:39,460
Should I bring it over?

220
00:21:39,660 --> 00:21:40,140
No.

221
00:21:40,299 --> 00:21:41,299
I'll buy some myself.

222
00:21:44,680 --> 00:21:45,319
(Next Episode)
Brother.

223
00:21:45,320 --> 00:21:46,359
Who's this?

224
00:21:46,700 --> 00:21:47,700
Shen Mo.

225
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:48,880
A therapist.

226
00:21:49,140 --> 00:21:49,900
Dr. Shen.

227
00:21:50,079 --> 00:21:52,339
Could I get a private bedtime session?

228
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:53,279
Brother Yu'an.

229
00:21:53,359 --> 00:21:54,359
Do you have a pet, too?

230
00:21:58,460 --> 00:21:59,019
Cheers!

231
00:21:59,019 --> 00:21:59,420
Cheers!

232
00:21:59,420 --> 00:22:00,019
Cheers!

233
00:22:00,259 --> 00:22:01,660
Truth or dare?

234
00:22:02,779 --> 00:22:03,420
Dare.

235
00:22:03,740 --> 00:22:05,939
The third person to your right...

236
00:22:05,940 --> 00:22:07,740
Hold their gaze for 30 seconds.

237
00:22:19,559 --> 00:22:20,160
Brother?

238
00:22:20,420 --> 00:22:21,420
Are you at home?
